&& Goals, a leaf requirement, a domain property, an agent, and an obstacle.
layout up
Goal @0,0 = /Goal/
Leaf @1,0 = !/Leaf requirement/
Descriptive @0,1 = ~Descriptive~
Agent @1,1 = <Agent 1>

Intended @2,0 = /Goal/
Risk @2,1 = \Risk\
Explanation @3,1 = {{Obstacle for this goal}}
Risk __> Intended [bar]
Explanation __> Risk
